---
// Mini Preview: back-to-top（返回顶部）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
    <div class="flex-1 rounded-control bg-card border border-line p-2 flex items-start gap-2">
      <div class="flex-1 h-full rounded-md bg-tag-bg"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 rounded-control bg-card border border-line p-2 flex items-start gap-2">
      <div class="flex-1 h-full rounded-md bg-tag-bg"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-5 right-5 w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-dark-bg text-white shadow-card flex items-center justify-center">
    <span class="text-sm leading-none">↑</span>
  </div>
  <p class="absolute bottom-2 inset-x-0 text-center text-[9px] text-muted">长页面末尾，一键回顶</p>
</div>